# Never let solution-spoiling material reach the app image. COPY . /opt/shop
# in Dockerfile.app makes source world-readable to appuser by design (that's
# what running the app needs) -- these paths document/explain the lab's own
# vulnerabilities in plain English and must not be reachable by a student who
# lands appuser code execution (Stage 9) or reads them off disk beforehand.
.git
docs
SECURITY.md
vulnerable/upload/README.md
vulnerable/privilege_escalation/README.md

# Ordinary build noise
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
